# Two Cups Cooling
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
If they find the cure, will you still sit here?
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
Of course.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
You answered very quickly.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
I have had years to think about this chair.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
I meant with me.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
The steam has faded. Neither of you reaches for the cups.
